licenses: playwright-core, bikeshed-now, @googleworkspace/cli and pdfjs-dist
(Apache-2.0); pdf-lib, docx, marked and cloakbrowser (MIT).

The CloakBrowser Chromium binary is downloaded by the `cloakbrowser` npm package
(MIT) into the gitignored .cache/ folder during `npm run setup`. The binary is
under its own license
(https://github.com/CloakHQ/CloakBrowser/blob/main/BINARY-LICENSE.md): free to
use, no redistribution, and no automated account creation. This repository never
contains or redistributes it. The wrapper contacts cloakbrowser.dev to check
licenses.
